1
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:03,630
No matter how ugly the feelings I
どれだけ酷い感情を

2
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:05,900
refine and polish,
推敲し磨いても

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,420
salvation, or whatever it's called,
救いとやらにはまだまだ

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,450
is still so far out of reach
程遠いままで

5
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,840
Even if I imitate the right answers,
正解の真似をしたって

6
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:15,470
in the end they're not mine
結局は僕のじゃない

7
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:17,510
I fear mistakes so much
間違いを恐れすぎて

8
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:20,300
that I can't choose anything
何も選べない

9
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,640
"Someday it'll pay off" —
いつか報われると

10
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:25,130
clutching words with no basis,
根拠もない言葉を抱いて

11
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:29,550
that's not how I want to exist
存在したいわけじゃないよ

12
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:34,230
I name this endless frustration "proof of existence"
終わらぬ苛立ちに「存在証明」と名付ける

13
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:36,690
Put a period after "unfinished"
「未完成」と句点を打って

14
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:39,250
and glibly wrapped everything up
安易に全てを括った

15
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:44,100
In a long night where I forgot the meaning of living,
生きる意味など忘れた永い夜の中で

16
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,500
words died, as if
言葉は死ぬように

17
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,500
leaving only regret as they vanished
無念を残し消えた

18
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:00,450
My heart, worn thin
磨り減る心

19
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,480
The words I wring out turn to ash
絞る言葉は灰になる

20
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,200
The ghost's face in the reflection
映る亡霊の顔が

21
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:08,200
asks, "Who the hell are you?"
「お前誰なんだ」と問う

22
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:10,700
In a spiral begging for life and death,
生と死を乞う螺旋の中

23
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:13,200
my consciousness crumbles away
意識が崩れ去る

24
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:15,300
The monologue kept on swelling
独白は膨らみ続け

25
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:17,780
until it became a monster
怪物になった

26
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:22,550
I name this unhealing wound "proof of existence"
終わらぬ傷口に「存在証明」と名付ける

27
00:01:22,550 --> 00:01:24,930
Put a period after "unfinished"
「未完成」と句点を打って

28
00:01:24,930 --> 00:01:27,330
then crumpled it up and threw it away
そして丸めて捨てた

29
00:01:27,330 --> 00:01:28,900
Clinging to a false dawn,
偽りの曙光に縋って

30
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:32,140
I pray, clumsily
不器用に祈るのさ

31
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:37,000
laughing mockingly: "It was all a dream"
全ては夢だったのだと嘲笑ってる

32
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,340
I wished to be saved,
救われたいと願った

33
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:41,940
and was killed by a worthless romanticism
つまらぬロマンチシズムに殺された

34
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:44,250
No one listens
誰も聞かず

35
00:01:44,250 --> 00:01:46,660
No one sees
誰も見ない

36
00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:47,930
My breath stops
呼吸は止まり

37
00:01:47,930 --> 00:01:51,220
and every voice and sound fades away
声も音もすべて消えていく

38
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:53,460
I tore it apart
引き裂いて

39
00:01:53,460 --> 00:01:56,370
and threw it all away
全部投げ捨てた

40
00:01:56,370 --> 00:01:58,730
"Someday it'll pay off" —
いつか報われると

41
00:01:58,730 --> 00:02:01,280
clutching words with no basis,
根拠もない言葉を抱いて

42
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:05,710
I just can't disappear, that's all
ただ消えられないだけだよ

43
00:02:05,710 --> 00:02:08,100
The unfinished file,
未完成のファイル

44
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:10,470
the half-written words
書きかけの言葉

45
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:14,000
still echo
まだ響いてる

46
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:22,550
I name this endless bitterness "proof of existence"
終わらぬ悔しさに「存在証明」と名付ける

47
00:02:22,550 --> 00:02:24,960
Put a period after "unfinished"
「未完成」と句点を打って

48
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:27,350
then quietly vanished
そして静かに消えた

49
00:02:27,350 --> 00:02:32,140
I held a song that reached no one's heart
誰の心にも届かない歌を抱いてた

50
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:36,940
and go on forcing this foolishness on everyone
この愚かさを皆に押し付けてゆく

51
00:02:36,940 --> 00:02:41,740
I name this endless fragility "proof of existence"
終わらぬ脆弱さに「存在証明」と名付ける

52
00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:44,130
Put a period after "unfinished"
「未完成」と句点を打って

53
00:02:44,130 --> 00:02:46,530
dissolving into a whisper
囁きに溶けていく

54
00:02:46,530 --> 00:02:51,320
In the final chapter I played, unknown to all,
誰も知らないままに奏でた終章の中で

55
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:53,720
from this world
この世界から

56
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:57,500
I vanished without a trace
跡形もなく消えた
